  "These tiny creatures have survived in outer space.",
  "Known as water bears, they are 8-legged micro-animals.",
  "Tardigrades live everywhere, from deep oceans to Antarctica.",
  "They are among the most resilient animals known.",
  "These tough survivors can endure extreme pressure and radiation.",
  "They also withstand dehydration and starvation that kill others.",
  "Their history stretches back 500 million years to the Cambrian."
